   * @x-autobe-authorization-type join
   * @x-autobe-authorization-actor administrator
   * @x-autobe-specification Create new administrator account by validating email uniqueness and password strength. Hash password using bcrypt. Set grade to 'regular' by default. Create initial session upon successful registration. Return JWT tokens for immediate authentication. Validate email format, password complexity (minimum 8 chars, mixed case, numbers). Ensure email is unique by checking against existing records. Set is_banned to false. Create ecommerce_mall_administrator_sessions record with JWT access and refresh tokens. Set appropriate expiration times based on security policy.
   * @nestia Generated by Nestia - https://github.com/samchon/nestia
   */
  @TypedRoute.Post("join")
