   *
   * Apply search filters:
   * - ban_status: 'active' (deleted_at IS NULL) or 'all' (include lifted bans)
   * - banned_at_start/banned_at_end: date range filtering on banned_at
   * - customer_email: partial text search on customer email
   * - customer_display_name: partial text search on customer display name
   * - administrator_id: filter by administrator who issued ban
   * - reason: partial text search on ban reason
   *
