   * - updated_at range: filter by last update date range
   * - reason: full-text search using GIN index on reason column
   * - requesting_member_id: filter by customer requester (UUID)
   * - requesting_seller_id: filter by seller requester (UUID)
   * - reviewing_super_admin_id: filter by reviewing super admin (UUID)
   *
   * Join with:
   * - ecommerce_mall_members for requesting member display_name and email
