   *
   * This endpoint returns complete details of an administrator approval request including the request status, reason provided by the user, and associated user information. The requester can be either a customer (member) or a seller, as indicated by the respective foreign key references. The response includes information about the super administrator who reviewed the request and the administrator account created if the request was approved.
