   *    - requestingSeller: seller profile (if requesting_seller_id is set)
   *    - reviewingSuperAdmin: super administrator who reviewed (if reviewing_super_admin_id is set)
   *    - createdAdmin: administrator account created (if created_admin_id is set)
   * 7. Construct response object with all fields
   * 8. Return 200 OK with full request object including nested related data
   *
   * Edge cases:
   * - Soft-deleted requests should be treated as not found
   * - Requests with both requesting_member_id and requesting_seller_id NULL should be rejected (invalid state)
   * - Related user records that were soft-deleted should be included but marked as deleted
   *
